def get_slide_data() -> dict:
    return {
        'title': 'Freeflow Environment',
        'content': '\n# Freeflow & Rarefied Gas Environment\n\nThe undisturbed freestream environment upstream of the bow shock is characterized by high rarefaction. In this regime, the continuum assumption fails, and gas must be modeled using kinetic theory:\n\n*   **<span class="glossary-term" data-def="A dimensionless parameter defined as the ratio of the molecular mean free path length to a representative physical length scale.">Knudsen Number ($Kn$)</span>**: \n    $$Kn = \\frac{\\lambda}{L}$$\n    *   $Kn < 0.01$: Continuum Flow (governed by Navier-Stokes).\n    *   $0.01 < Kn < 0.1$: Slip Flow.\n    *   $0.1 < Kn < 10$: Transitional Flow.\n    *   $Kn > 10$: Free Molecular Flow.\n\n*   **<span class="glossary-term" data-def="The average distance traveled by a gas molecule between successive collisions with other moving molecules.">Mean Free Path ($\\lambda$)</span>**: \n    $$\\lambda = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2} \\pi d^2 n}$$\n    As altitude increases, density $n$ drops exponentially, leading to a massive increase in $\\lambda$.\n\n*   **<span class="glossary-term" data-def="A flow regime where the mean free path of the gas molecules is comparable to or larger than the characteristic length scale of the vehicle.">Rarefied Gas Dynamics</span>**:\n    At high entry altitudes (e.g. $>80\\text{ km}$), the rarefied atmosphere requires the use of Direct Simulation Monte Carlo (DSMC) methods instead of traditional CFD solvers.\n\n\n## Solver Selection & LBM Stability Limits from Slide Deck:\n<div style="text-align:center; margin: 1rem 0;">\n    <img src="LaTeX/slide_images/presentation_slide-35.png" alt="Lattice Boltzmann Stability Limits" style="max-width:95%; border-radius:8px; border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1); box-shadow:0 4px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);">\n</div>\n\n---\n<div style="margin-top: 1.5rem; text-align: right;">\n    <a href="#" class="back-btn" style="margin-bottom:0; background:rgba(99,102,241,0.15); border-color:rgba(99,102,241,0.3); color:#a5b4fc;" onclick="zoomToSector(\'shock\', 0)">Return to Diagnostics Hub &larr;</a>\n</div>\n'
    }
